@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-03 - View Product Detail

actor "Guest" as Actor
boundary "Product UI" as FE
control "ShoesController / ReviewsController" as API
control "ShoesService / ReviewsService" as Service
database "MongoDB: shoes, shoesDetail, reviews" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-03
FE -> API: GET /shoes/detail/:productId
API -> Service: Execute View Product Detail
Service -> DB: Read/write shoes, shoesDetail, reviews
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Trang chi tiết sản phẩm hiển thị

alt Alternative / exception flow
  note over FE,Service: productId không tồn tại -> 404 page
end

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Có productId hợp lệ
Post: Trang chi tiết sản phẩm hiển thị
Main flow:
1. User click vào 1 sản phẩm
2. System gọi API GET /shoes/detail/:productId
3. System trả về: name, category, price, colors[], images[], sizes[],\ndescription, materialNote, origin, rating, reviewCount
4. Frontend hiển thị image gallery, color picker, size picker, stock\nindicator
5. System đồng thời gọi GET /reviews/product/:productId
end note
@enduml
